---
export const prerender = true;
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

const lastUpdated = '2025-01-01';
---

<Layout
 title="DMCA. TikSaveHub"
 description="DMCA compliance page for TikSaveHub. Report copyrighted content and learn about our copyright infringement policy."
 keywords="dmca, copyright, copyright infringement, takedown notice, tiksavehub dmca"
 canonical="/dmca"
 ogImage="/og-dmca.png"
 skipSoftwareApp
>
 <section class="legal-section" aria-labelledby="legal-headline">
 <div class="legal-inner container-page">
 <!-- Breadcrumb -->
 <nav aria-label="Breadcrumb" class="legal-breadcrumb">
 <ol class="breadcrumb-list">
 <li>
 <a href="/"><span>Home</span></a>
 </li>
 <li aria-current="page">
 <span>DMCA</span>
 </li>
 </ol>
 </nav>

 <div class="legal-header">
 <span class="section-eyebrow text-caption-mono">Legal</span>
 <h1 id="legal-headline" class="legal-title">DMCA Compliance</h1>
 <p class="legal-meta">Last updated: {lastUpdated} &middot; Effective: {lastUpdated}</p>
 </div>

 <div class="legal-card">
 <div class="legal-content">

 <section class="legal-clause">
 <h2 class="legal-h2">1. Copyright Infringement Notice</h2>
 <p>
 TikSaveHub respects the intellectual property rights of others and expects its users to do the same. In accordance with the Digital Millennium Copyright Act (DMCA), we will respond promptly to notices of alleged copyright infringement submitted to our designated copyright agent.
 </p>
 </section>

 <section class="legal-clause">
 <h2 class="legal-h2">2. How to File a DMCA Notice</h2>
 <p>
 If you believe that content available through TikSaveHub infringes your copyright, please send a written notice to our designated agent containing the following information:
 </p>
 <ul class="legal-list">
 <li>A physical or electronic signature of the copyright owner or a person authorized to act on their behalf.</li>
 <li>Identification of the copyrighted work claimed to have been infringed.</li>
 <li>The URL or location of the allegedly infringing material on TikSaveHub.</li>
 <li>Your contact information: name, address, telephone number, and email address.</li>
 <li>A statement that you have a good-faith belief that the disputed use is not authorized by the copyright owner, its agent, or the law.</li>
 <li>A statement, made under penalty of perjury, that the information in the notice is accurate and that you are the copyright owner or authorized to act on their behalf.</li>
 </ul>
 </section>

 <section class="legal-clause">
 <h2 class="legal-h2">3. Submit a DMCA Notice</h2>
 <p>
 Please send your DMCA notice to:
 </p>
 <p class="legal-contact">
 <strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:samneil7582@gmail.com">samneil7582@gmail.com</a><br />
 <strong>Subject:</strong> DMCA Notice
 </p>
 </section>

 <section class="legal-clause">
 <h2 class="legal-h2">4. Counter-Notification</h2>
 <p>
 If you believe that material you posted was removed or access to it was disabled in error, you may submit a counter-notification. Your counter-notification must include:
 </p>
 <ul class="legal-list">
 <li>Your physical or electronic signature.</li>
 <li>Identification of the material that was removed and its location before removal.</li>
 <li>A statement under penalty of perjury that you have a good-faith belief the material was removed as a result of mistake or misidentification.</li>
 <li>Your name, address, telephone number, and email address.</li>
 <li>A statement consenting to the jurisdiction of the federal district court for your address, or any judicial district in which TikSaveHub may be found.</li>
 </ul>
 </section>

 <section class="legal-clause">
 <h2 class="legal-h2">5. Repeat Infringers</h2>
 <p>
 In accordance with the DMCA and other applicable laws, TikSaveHub maintains a policy of terminating, in appropriate circumstances, users who are deemed to be repeat infringers. We also reserve the right to limit access to the Service and/or terminate the accounts of any users who infringe the intellectual property rights of others, whether or not there is any repeat infringement.
 </p>
 </section>

 <section class="legal-clause">
 <h2 class="legal-h2">6. Limitations</h2>
 <p>
 TikSaveHub is a video downloader tool. We do not host, store, or distribute copyrighted content on our servers. Downloaded videos are delivered directly to the user's device and are not stored by us. However, we take copyright claims seriously and will investigate all valid DMCA notices.
 </p>
 </section>

 </div>
 </div>

 <!-- Back to home -->
 <div class="legal-back">
 <a href="/" class="btn-primary-sm">&larr; Back to TikSaveHub</a>
 </div>
 </div>
 </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .legal-section {
    background-color: var(--color-canvas-soft);
    padding: var(--spacing-5xl) var(--spacing-lg);
  }

  .legal-inner {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--spacing-2xl);
    max-width: 760px;
    margin-inline: auto;
  }

  .legal-breadcrumb {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .breadcrumb-list {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    font-size: var(--text-body-sm);
    color: var(--color-mute);
  }

  .breadcrumb-list li + li::before {
    content: '/';
    margin-right: 6px;
    color: var(--color-hairline-strong);
  }

  .breadcrumb-list a {
    color: var(--color-body);
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: color 0.15s ease;
  }

  .breadcrumb-list a:hover {
    color: var(--color-ink);
  }

  .legal-header {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--spacing-sm);
  }

  .section-eyebrow {
    color: var(--color-mute);
  }

  .legal-title {
    font-size: var(--text-display-xl);
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1.05;
    letter-spacing: -2.5px;
    color: var(--color-ink);
    margin: 0;
  }

  .legal-meta {
    font-size: var(--text-body-sm);
    color: var(--color-mute);
    margin: 0;
  }

  .legal-card {
    background-color: var(--color-canvas);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    padding: var(--spacing-3xl);
    box-shadow:
      inset 0 0 0 1px #0000000a,
      0px 1px 1px #00000005,
      0px 4px 8px #0000000a;
  }

  .legal-content {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--spacing-2xl);
  }

  .legal-clause {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--spacing-md);
  }

  .legal-h2 {
    font-size: var(--text-display-md);
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: -1.28px;
    color: var(--color-ink);
    margin: 0;
    line-height: 1.25;
  }

  .legal-content p {
    font-size: var(--text-body-md);
    color: var(--color-body);
    line-height: 1.75;
    margin: 0;
    letter-spacing: -0.1px;
  }

  .legal-list {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--spacing-sm);
  }

  .legal-list li {
    font-size: var(--text-body-md);
    color: var(--color-body);
    line-height: 1.7;
    padding-left: 20px;
    position: relative;
    letter-spacing: -0.1px;
  }

  .legal-list li::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    top: 9px;
    width: 6px;
    height: 6px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--color-grad-develop-start), var(--color-cyan));
  }

  .legal-content a {
    color: var(--color-link);
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 2px;
    transition: color 0.15s ease;
  }

  .legal-content a:hover {
    color: var(--color-link-deep);
  }

  .legal-contact {
    background-color: var(--color-canvas-soft);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    padding: var(--spacing-lg);
    font-size: var(--text-body-md);
    color: var(--color-body);
    line-height: 1.75;
  }

  .legal-contact strong {
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-ink);
  }

  .legal-back {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .btn-primary-sm {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--spacing-xs);
    padding: var(--spacing-xs) var(--spacing-lg);
    border-radius: var(--radius-full);
    background-color: var(--color-ink);
    color: var(--color-on-primary);
    font-size: var(--text-body-sm);
    font-weight: 500;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: opacity 0.2s ease, transform 0.2s ease;
    border: none;
    cursor: pointer;
    line-height: 2.2;
    letter-spacing: -0.1px;
  }

  .btn-primary-sm:hover {
    opacity: 0.85;
    transform: translateY(-1px);
  }

  .dark .legal-card {
    box-shadow:
      inset 0 0 0 1px #ffffff0a,
      0px 1px 1px #00000010,
      0px 4px 8px #00000020;
  }

  .dark .legal-contact {
    background-color: var(--color-canvas-soft-2);
  }

  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .legal-section {
      padding: var(--spacing-4xl) var(--spacing-md);
    }

    .legal-title {
      font-size: 32px;
      letter-spacing: -1.5px;
    }

    .legal-card {
      padding: var(--spacing-lg);
    }

    .legal-h2 {
      font-size: var(--text-display-sm);
    }

    .breadcrumb-list {
      font-size: var(--text-caption);
    }
  }
</style>
